       "meta-title": "Quote to Cash Automation for Every Handoff | Emergent",
       "meta-description": "Build quote to cash automation that opens orders from accepted quotes, holds invoices that drift from the quote, and drafts renewals.",
       "name": "Build Quote to Cash Automation That Hands Off Every Stage",
       "acrm---product-name": "Quote to Cash Automation Builder",
       "description": "Build quote to cash automation that turns accepted quotes into orders and invoices that match, on a database you own.",
       "acrm---breadcrumb": "Quote to Cash Automation",
       "explore-cta": "Build My Quote to Cash Automation",
       "acrm---why-emergent-title": "Why Build Quote to Cash Flows With Emergent?",
       "acrm---key-feature-filter-1": "Quote to Order",
       "awb---how-to-title": "How to Automate Quote to Cash",
       "awb---how-to-description": "Seven steps to map your deal handoffs and build quote to cash automation with Emergent.",
       "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Quote to Cash Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is quote to cash automation?\", \"a\": \"Quote to cash automation is software that carries a deal through each stage after pricing without anyone retyping it. The accepted quote becomes an order, the order becomes an invoice, and the payment closes the record. Zuora describes quote to cash as the stretch between the initial customer quote and the actual cash collected, covering quotes, orders, and invoices.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I set up quote to cash automation?\", \"a\": \"Start with one handoff, such as accepted quote to sales order, and describe it in a prompt to Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-automation-builder'>AI automation builder</a>. Emergent builds the app and its database, and the app connects to your CRM and accounting system through their APIs. Test it on one real deal, then add the next stage.\"}, {\"q\": \"Which steps does quote to cash automation cover after the customer accepts?\", \"a\": \"It covers the seven that follow the quote. Conga lists 10 quote-to-cash steps: configuration, pricing, quoting, contract creation, contract negotiation, contract execution, order fulfillment, billing, revenue recognition, and renewal. The first three happen before acceptance and belong to the quote itself; the app picks up at contract creation and runs through to renewal.\"}, {\"q\": \"Does quote to cash automation start when the deal is won or when the quote goes out?\", \"a\": \"It starts when the quote goes out. Zuora draws the line this way: order-to-cash traditionally begins only after a contract is signed, while quote to cash moves the starting line upstream to include quoting. The work before the first quote, like lead follow-up, belongs to <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-automation-builder/sales'>sales automation</a>.\"}, {\"q\": \"What data should quote to cash automation copy onto the invoice?\", \"a\": \"Every line on the accepted quote should reach the invoice unchanged, prices and discounts included, along with the payment terms. Add the customer's PO number if they gave one. Keep the quote number on the invoice as a reference, and anyone can trace a billed line back to what the customer accepted.\"}, {\"q\": \"How should quote to cash automation handle a change after the customer accepts?\", \"a\": \"Treat the change as a new version of the quote, not an edit to the order. Have the customer accept the revised quote, then let the app update the order and the invoice from that version. Every invoice then traces back to terms the customer agreed to. With Emergent, every version sits in a database you own.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can one tool run quote to cash automation and marketing workflows?\", \"a\": \"Yes, with a builder that makes whole apps, not single connectors. In Emergent, each workflow starts as a plain-English prompt. A finance team's quote to cash app and a marketing team's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-automation-builder/seo'>seo automation</a> can come from the same builder, each with its own data and its own owner.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I measure quote-to-cash automation results?\", \"a\": \"Track the days between stages, not only the total: quote sent to accepted, accepted to order, order to invoice, and invoice to paid. Measure those 4 gaps for a month before the app goes live, then compare them a month after. The gap that shrinks least is the next one to rework.\"}, {\"q\": \"When should quote to cash automation draft a renewal quote?\", \"a\": \"Set it 60 days before the term ends for an annual plan with one approver, and 90 days for a customer whose purchasing team reviews every renewal. Conga lists renewal as the last of its 10 quote-to-cash steps, and the app starts it as a fresh quote with last term's lines.\"}, {\"q\": \"What happens before a deal reaches quote to cash automation?\", \"a\": \"A lead becomes a qualified opportunity, and the opportunity gets a price. Lead capture and nurture emails belong to a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-automation-builder/marketing-workflow'>marketing automation workflow</a>, and quote to cash starts once a rep sends the first quote. Pass the contact and the deal amount into that quote, and nobody retypes them at the start.\"}]}; </script></div></div>",
       "alpb---prompt-filter-1": "Quote to Order",
       "alpb---prompt": "<p>Build quote to cash automation that runs on its own and logs every step.</p><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbPrompt = {\"default\": \"Build quote to cash automation that runs on its own and logs every step.\", \"chips\": [{\"label\": \"Quote to Order\", \"add\": \"Add a quote to order handoff that opens a sales order with the accepted quote's lines.\"}, {\"label\": \"Invoice Matching\", \"add\": \"Add invoice matching that holds any invoice whose total differs from the accepted quote.\"}, {\"label\": \"Renewal Quotes\", \"add\": \"Add renewal quotes drafted 60 days before each service plan ends.\"}, {\"label\": \"Cycle Times\", \"add\": \"Add a dashboard of cycle times that shows the days each stage takes.\"}]}; </script></div></div>",
